/* French UI translations.
   The key is the English text exactly as it appears in code — a SwiftUI
   literal, a String(localized:) literal (interpolations appear as format
   specifiers: %@, %lld, and a literal % as %%), or the full sentence a
   Localized.lookup(...) site assembles. A key missing from this table falls
   back to English; scripts/extract-localizable-keys.sh --missing lists the
   compiler-extractable gaps, and LocalizationTableTests pins the assembled
   ones. Plural-sensitive keys live in Localizable.stringsdict instead. */

